<title>CHINA: China October consumer inflation 7 pct -state data.</title>
<headline>China October consumer inflation 7 pct -state data.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's October consumer price inflation was 7.0 percent, down 0.4 percentage points from September, the State Statistical Bureau said on Monday.</p>
</text>
